    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You were built for the trigger. Maybe a corp warframe walked free of its handlers; maybe a Flats veteran who learned that the only law down here is tempo. Either way, you are the crew's front rank - the body between the team and the muzzle flash.</p><p>Your engine is <strong>Adrenaline</strong>: you do not open a fight full. You bank it through the discipline of the trigger - each measured burst, each round you hold the line - and spend it to escalate when the tempo turns your way. Operators are chrome-forward and cast nothing; every edge you have, you bought with steel, wire, and nerve.</p>",
